    "detailed_description": "As a person who stumbles into a mysterious residence, you find yourself uncovering the owner's tragic history while learning how you fit into this story about love, redemption, and hope.<br><br>Explore, decipher, and unlock more of your environment and its many secrets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautiful atmospheric environments to explore and discover<br></li><li>Unravel the mystery of the Beast's emotive backstory through personal journals and memoirs<br></li><li>Examine important items up close and decipher their connection to the story<br></li><li>Solve simple navigation puzzles as you explore the many rooms of the Beast's residence<br></li><li>Fluid and elegant controls and gameplay</li></ul>",
